<view class="page">

  <!-- 品牌区 -->
  <view class="brand">
    <view class="logo">💊</view>
    <view class="brand-name">康宁大药房</view>
    <view class="brand-sub">家庭常备药 · 正品直营 · 药师在线</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 头像选择 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">选择头像</view>
    <view class="avatars">
      <view
        class="av {{avatarIdx === index ? 'on' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{avatars}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        data-idx="{{index}}"
        bindtap="pickAvatar"
      >{{item}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">昵称</text>
      <input
        class="field-input"
        placeholder="选填，默认「微信用户」"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        maxlength="16"
        value="{{nickname}}"
        bindinput="onNickname"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">手机号</text>
      <input
        class="field-input"
        type="number"
        placeholder="请输入 11 位手机号"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        maxlength="11"
        value="{{phone}}"
        bindinput="onPhone"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="field-note">手机号仅用于登录与订单通知，本地演示不做上传</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 协议 -->
  <view class="agree-row" bindtap="toggleAgree">
    <view class="agree-box {{agree ? 'on' : ''}}">
      <text wx:if="{{agree}}" class="agree-ico">✓</text>
    </view>
    <view class="agree-txt">
      我已阅读并同意
      <text class="link" catchtap="showAgreement">《用户协议与隐私说明》</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 操作 -->
  <view class="actions">
    <view class="btn btn-primary login-btn" bindtap="submit">登录</view>
    <view class="btn btn-ghost demo-btn" bindtap="quickLogin">一键填入示例资料</view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    演示账号不会产生真实短信验证；正式项目建议使用
    wx.login 换取 openid + 后端手机号解密，并做好频次限制与风控。
  </view>

</view>
